\newlabel{tab:validity}{{2}{6}{Instrument validation and comparators (sealed evaluation, three seeds). Ratios are mean over the 15 real cases of $\mathrm {clip}(\log _2(k_{\text {cmp}}/\kver ),-4,4)$ with a 95\% bootstrap CI over cases. Positive values mean the comparator needed more rows. $^\dagger $Interpretation relies on the harness's stated scoring rule}{table.caption.19}{}}
