\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Verified perturbation sizes for all 15 real cases, on two scales (log axes). (a) Count $\hat  {k}$ of comparisons dropped or flipped; integers are annotated. (b) The same sizes as a percentage of the source's comparisons, $\hat  {k}/n$. Colors mark the target and perturbation; top-$k$ is top-5 for Arena and NBA and top-3 for MT-Bench (MTB). Sizes are identical across the three seeds.}}{7}{figure.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:main}{{2}{7}{Verified perturbation sizes for all 15 real cases, on two scales (log axes). (a) Count $\kver $ of comparisons dropped or flipped; integers are annotated. (b) The same sizes as a percentage of the source's comparisons, $\kver /n$. Colors mark the target and perturbation; top-$k$ is top-5 for Arena and NBA and top-3 for MT-Bench (MTB). Sizes are identical across the three seeds}{figure.caption.20}{}}
